    {
      "source": "Interface to allow execution of QueryDsl <code>Predicate</code> instances. This an extension to\n<a href=\"QuerydslPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>QuerydslPredicateExecutor</code></a> returning <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> instead of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> where applicable.",
      "translation": "提供执行 QueryDsl <code>Predicate</code> 实例的接口。这是对<a href=\"QuerydslPredicateExecutor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl\"><code>QuerydslPredicateExecutor</code></a>的扩展，在适用情况下返回<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>而非<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all entities matching the given <code>Predicate</code> applying the given <a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>. In case no match could\nbe found an empty <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> is returned.",
      "translation": "返回所有匹配给定<code>Predicate</code>并应用给定<a href=\"../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>的实体。如果未找到任何匹配项，则返回一个空的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
